{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracking plan is the contract between an app and whoever reads its events: dashboards, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"warehouse, a collector, another platform’s client. Each event’s document gives its version,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consent category, properties and their JSON types, which ones every payload holds, and which are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", in a form that needs no Swift to read. Committed beside the events, it puts every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change to them in the pull request as a JSON diff. Its check says which changes break what has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already shipped: payloads from installed app versions that a validating collector would reject,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and stored records the app could no longer decode."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan"},{"text":" turns events’ schemas into files: an index, ","type":"text"},{"code":"tracking-plan.json","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and for each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event a JSON Schema (draft 2020-12) document and an example payload. The files are values, so the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same schemas give the same bytes on every run and platform, ready to commit for the people and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tools outside the app.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Checking compares the plan the events make now with the committed one by what the files mean. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck"},{"type":"text","text":" is a match, a plan that is only out of date, or one with a breaking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"difference: a change that, at the same version, would leave a stored record or an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already-released app’s payload unable to decode or validate. Each "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference"},{"type":"text","text":" names"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the event, the property and the change, and says whether it is breaking."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Only code compiled against the app’s event types can read their schemas, so the app writes a small","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"executable of its own: a type that conforms to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", marked ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@main"},{"text":". It writes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the plan to a directory, or checks it with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check"},{"text":". To run the check from the app’s tests instead,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlanTesting"},{"text":". The schemas usually come from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"text":" (module ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EventMacros"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The module is a product of its own that "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Traffluent"},{"type":"text","text":" leaves out."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import TrackingPlans","import Traffluent","","@Event(name: \"signed_up\")","struct SignedUp {","    var plan: String","}","","let plan = TrackingPlan(schemas: [SignedUp.schema])","let check = plan.check(against: plan.files)  \/\/ .matches","let paths = plan.files.map(\\.path)","\/\/ [\"tracking-plan.json\", \"signed_up.v1.schema.json\", \"signed_up.v1.example.json\"]"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The guide "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers the executable, the command plugins and the test."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/File","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanError"],"anchor":"Making-a-plan","title":"Making a plan"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files(carryingForward:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/write(to:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand"],"anchor":"Writing-a-plan","title":"Writing a plan"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(against:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(againstDirectory:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference"],"anchor":"Checking-a-plan","title":"Checking a plan"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans","